; Pocket cut into a filleted box's flat top, far from every blend. The
; cut splits the top face and pushes the new vertices onto the adjacent
; blends' end rulings; dropping them collapsed those blends flat.
[let pocket [translate 40.0 40.0 90.0 [cube 20.0 20.0 20.0]]]
[let body [difference pocket [fillet 12.0 [cube 100.0 100.0 100.0]]]]
#[body [difference pocket [cube 100.0 100.0 100.0]]]
